==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|mánuðr|lang=non}} from {{term|máni||a moon|lang=non}}. Cognate English {{term|month}}, Old English {{term|monaþ|mōnaþ}}, German {{term|Monat|lang=de}}, Danish {{term|måned|lang=da}} and Swedish {{term|månad|lang=sv}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmauːnʏːðʏr/|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m}}

# a [[month]]

